    "answer": "Victims of road‑traffic accidents are eligible for assistance under the **Vahan Aksmat Sahay** Scheme. To receive help, a person must:\n\n- Be a victim of a road‑traffic accident,  \n- Require immediate medical treatment for injuries sustained in the accident,  \n- Receive treatment at a hospital empanelled under the Vahan Aksmat Sahay Scheme,  \n- Have a Medico‑Legal Case registered for the accident, and  \n- Have police intimation with acknowledgment for the accident【scheme_02_vahan_aksmat_sahay, eligibility】.",
